units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 1
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 75 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region target block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 55 75 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
group target region target
group projectile region projectile
mass 1 92.906
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix equil all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
unfix equil
velocity projectile set 0 0 -20 sum yes
fix impact all nve
run 100000
